meta {
  name: User API
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  # User-facing API

  Everything an operator (or UI) calls, mounted at `{{baseUrl}}` (`…/v1`).
  All requests require a **user JWT** — inherited from the collection, so
  they work out of the box.

  Grouped by resource; each request documents its parameters, body and
  response. Target state flows *devices ← assignments ← configs/versions*,
  and the device reports back into the `Reported State` resources.
}
